        "hadith": 65913,
        "wording": {
          "ar": "الحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ الَّذِي أَحْيَانَا بَعْدَمَا أَمَاتَنَا، وَإِلَيْهِ النُّشُورُ",
          "draftMeaningEn": "Praise belongs to Allah, who gave us life after causing us to die. To Him is the resurrection."
